class_name ChunkLibrary
extends RefCounted
## Hand-designed level pieces. Each level (resources/levels/*.tres) lists its own order of
## chunks, so the 24 levels have different layouts while every piece is tested once.
##
## Rows are aligned to the bottom of a 22-row level. The last row of every chunk is row 18;
## row 17 is the main ground surface. The builder extends the last row down to row 21.
##
## Legend
##  .  empty          #  ground            =  one-way platform    H  ladder
##  ^  spikes         L  lava / deep water P  player start        C  checkpoint
##  E  exit gate      o  coin              g  gem                 +  heart
##  T  treasure chest B  breakable crate   X  secret breakable wall
##  ?  coin block     J  spring            M  moving platform (horizontal)
##  V  moving platform (vertical)          F  falling platform    Z  saw blade
##  W  crusher        1-6 power-ups (1 double jump, 2 shield, 3 speed, 4 heal, 5 crit, 6 energy)
##  !  random power-up                     a b c d  enemy slots (resolved per world)
##  h  leaping fish   n  chomper           t  torch    I  hint sign    O  boss spawn

